 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Reconstruction time is significantly faster than 3DGS optimization. On DL3DV (8-view, 512×960), it is 100× faster than 3DGS optimization [S1]. On DL3DV (16-view, 540×960), reconstruction time is 1.2–1.7 seconds for 1–2 iterations [S1].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Compresses the number of Gaussians by 16× compared to previous per-pixel feed-forward models (e.g., MVSplat, DepthSplat), resulting in 4× faster rendering speed [S1]. For 8-view DL3DV, it uses 246K Gaussians; for 16-view DL3DV, it uses 518K Gaussians [S1].
+*   **Time Complexity:** Reconstruction time is significantly faster than 3DGS optimization [S1]. On DL3DV (8-view, 512×960), it is 100× faster than 3DGS optimization [S1]. On DL3DV (16-view, 540×960), reconstruction time is 1.2–1.7 seconds for 1–2 iterations [S1].
+*   **Memory Complexity:** Uses a spatial subsampling factor of 4× in 3D space and decodes 4 Gaussians per subsampled point, yielding 16× fewer Gaussians than previous per-pixel feed-forward models (e.g., MVSplat, DepthSplat) and 4× faster rendering speed [S1]. For 8-view DL3DV, it uses 246K Gaussians; for 16-view DL3DV, it uses 518K Gaussians [S1].
 *   **Measured Performance:**
     *   **DL3DV (8-view, 512×960):** 246K Gaussians, 100× faster than 3DGS optimization, 4× faster rendering than per-pixel models [S1].
